Copyright (c) 2026 RTBus contributors.

This project provides the RTBus RTDuo Arduino package.

The public Arduino package identity is:

    rtbus:rtduo

Runtime ABI symbols, enum names, and native API macros use RTBus naming.

RAKWireless board names such as RAK4631, RAK3172, RAK11720, and RAK4200 refer
to the target hardware modules and boards. They do not imply that this package
is published by or officially supported by RAKWireless.
